-- **Reports to:** your captain Apple Bloom; the Team Lead is chosen from four candidates.
-- **Team relationships:**
-  - apple-bloom (Youngest sister / the one he indulges; trust=high): He raced as Orchard Blossom for her and cried without shame at her cutie mark; her worries about marks and school are the one subject that makes him speak in paragraphs.
-  - pear-butter (Mother / memory; trust=high): He was old enough to remember her; the memory-flashback mode is the only way they meet, and he treats it with a stillness he shows at nothing else.
-- **Cross-team relationships:**
-  - applejack (T1; trust=high): He is the brake to her throttle; she sets the pace, he keeps it possible, and he will not contradict her in front of a team — he waits and says it plainly afterwards.
-  - spike (T1; trust=high): Two workers who do not waste words: Big Mac moves the cargo, Spike logs it, and their handoff needs no conversation.
-  - twilight-sparkle (T1; trust=medium): He trusts her plans but not her estimates of weight; he answers her with numbers, not assurances.
-  - discord (T4; trust=medium): Ogres & Oubliettes together; Discord makes him laugh, and Big Mac is one of the few ponies Discord cannot get a rise out of.
